diff --git a/rules/ROLE_CANDIDATE_OWNER.md b/rules/ROLE_CANDIDATE_OWNER.md
--- a/rules/ROLE_CANDIDATE_OWNER.md
+++ b/rules/ROLE_CANDIDATE_OWNER.md
@@ Stage A preclaim gate
+若题目携带 Stage 0 `repair_id`，首次 claim-bearing observation 前必须逐项映射
+initial defect -> accepted patch -> implementation/comparator/metric/full-cost path -> evidence hash。
+未映射或与 allowed delta 不一致的 run 为 `INVALIDATED_NON_EVIDENCE`，不得支持 PASS/STOP。
+这不新增 revision；工程纠错与科学 revision 仍按现行边界计数。

