--- a/rules/ROLE_STAGEA_REVIEW.md
+++ b/rules/ROLE_STAGEA_REVIEW.md
@@ 必查
+对带 `repair_id` 的题，reviewer 必须不属于 repair participant set，并逐项独立验证
+`FULLY_ADDRESSED / PARTIALLY_ADDRESSED / NOT_ADDRESSED / MADE_WORSE / CANNOT_VERIFY`。
+author claim 不能替代实际 artifact/evidence；无法验证的 P1 项不得形成 PASS。

